  "question": {
    "text": "On addition of $1 \\mathrm{~mL}$ of $10 \\% \\mathrm{NaCl}$ solution to 10 $\\mathrm{mL}$ gold sol in the presence of $0.025 \\mathrm{~g}$ of starch, the coagulation is just prevented. Starch has gold number",
